---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Brais Fernández | Backend & Cloud Engineer">
  <!-- Section Hero -->
  <section class="py-8 sm:py-16 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 text-xs font-mono">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      Ingeniero Informático
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-100 leading-tight">
      Desarrollo <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-blue-600">Backend</span> & Arquitecturas Cloud.
    </h1>

    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Especializado en sistemas distribuidos, arquitectura de microservicios, desarrollo backend y observabilidad.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row w-full sm:w-auto gap-3 pt-2">
      <a href="#proyectos" class="px-5 py-3 sm:py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold text-sm transition-all text-center shadow-lg shadow-sky-500/20">
        Ver Proyectos
      </a>
      <a href="#contacto" class="px-5 py-3 sm:py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 text-slate-300 font-medium text-sm transition-all text-center">
        Contactar
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Tech Stack -->
  <section class="py-6 sm:py-8 border-y border-slate-800/60 my-6 sm:my-10">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mb-4">Tecnologías & Herramientas</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
      {["Java / Spring Boot", "Python / Django", "MongoDB", "PostgreSQL", "MySQL", "AWS", "Docker", "Ansible", "Vagrant", "MinIO", "Prometheus / Grafana", "GitHub Actions", "HL7 FHIR / openEHR"].map((tech) => (
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300">
          {tech}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Experiencia y Educación -->
  <section id="experiencia" class="py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-200">Experiencia y Educación</h2>
    
    <div class="relative border-l border-slate-800 ml-3 space-y-8">
      <!-- Experiencia Accenture -->
      <div class="pl-6 relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[6.5px] top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sky-500 border-2 border-slate-950"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400">Mar. 2026 - Jul. 2026</span>
        <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-0.5">Software Engineer (Prácticas)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Accenture · La Coruña (Híbrido)</p>
        <ul class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Desarrollo de servicios backend y API REST con <strong>Java</strong> y <strong>Spring Boot</strong> bajo arquitectura de microservicios e integración de <strong>arquitectura hexagonal</strong>.</li>
          <li>Persistencia y gestión de datos con <strong>MongoDB</strong> y seguridad mediante <strong>Bearer Tokens</strong>.</li>
          <li>Pruebas de APIs con Postman, despliegue continuo con <strong>GitHub Actions</strong> y monitorización de logs en <strong>AWS CloudWatch</strong>.</li>
          <li>Participación en proyectos del sector sanitario trabajando con estándares de interoperabilidad clínica (<strong>HL7 FHIR</strong> y <strong>openEHR</strong>) bajo metodología Agile.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Educación: MUEI -->
      <div class="pl-6 relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[6.5px] top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sky-500/60 border-2 border-slate-950"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400">Actualmente</span>
        <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-0.5">Máster Universitario en Ingeniería Informática (MUEI)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Universidade da Coruña (UDC)</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Especialización en arquitectura de software avanzada, sistemas distribuidos, computación en la nube y gestión de infraestructura.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Educación: Grado -->
      <div class="pl-6 relative">
        <span class="absolute -left-[6.5px] top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-700 border-2 border-slate-950"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Graduación</span>
        <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mt-0.5">Grado en Ingeniería Informática</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Universidade da Coruña (UDC)</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Formación completa orientada al desarrollo backend, ingeniería del software, bases de datos y sistemas operativos.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Proyectos Destacados -->
  <section id="proyectos" class="py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-200">Proyectos Destacados</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
      <article class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800/80 hover:border-slate-700 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">tfg-minio-lgtm</h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-sky-400 bg-sky-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-sky-500/20">Open Source</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Infraestructura de almacenamiento S3-compatible con MinIO y pila de observabilidad LGTM (Grafana, Loki, Mimir, Tempo) desplegada mediante automatización con Ansible y entornos virtualizados con Vagrant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800/60 pt-3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
            <span>Ansible</span> • <span>Vagrant</span> • <span>Docker</span> • <span>MinIO</span> • <span>Grafana</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://github.com/braisfernandezr/tfg-minio-lgtm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-400 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Ver código en GitHub &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Contacto -->
  <section id="contacto" class="py-8 sm:py-12 border-t border-slate-800/60 space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-200">Contacto</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
      Si quieres hablar sobre desarrollo backend, infraestructura cloud o posibles oportunidades, puedes contactarme a través de:
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
      <a href="https://github.com/braisfernandezr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z"/></svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brais-fern%C3%A1ndez-reyes-3263723b7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 text-slate-200 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
        LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>